{"body":{"matters":"where the final say comes to rest","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000046"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200004S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000052"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000053"}],"prose":"The held space describes a society of parts that is said to need no centre, and then, wherever the parts must agree, places something above them with the last word. Everything else in it, faculties, meaning, simulation, the rural ground, is arranged around that rising seat of authority.","title":"A headless whole that grows a head"},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000045","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"how difference among parts is held together","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000047"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200004C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200004F"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200004N"}],"prose":"How the parts are given distinct faculties, how they come to disagree, how something settles their disagreements, and the shared speech that makes settling possible.","title":"The working society of parts"},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000046","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"which faculty a part carries","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000048"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G2000049"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200004A"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200004B"}],"prose":"Capacities a single agent would hold together, judging, seeing, foreseeing, are separated and handed to different kinds of part, which then must feed one another.","title":"Faculties dealt out to parts"},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000047","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"what counts as a fair or right decision","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003RT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003VP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100040N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004RR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004V7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004YA"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004ZM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100051N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100078M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007BE"}],"prose":"One part keeps to rules of right and wrong, another checks for skew; both appear later as validation layers that inspect what others produce.","title":"Faculties of judgment"},"id":"1M6YBY3G2000048","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
