{"body":{"matters":"how far ahead consequences are counted","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100043X"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100046H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100048P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004C1"}],"prose":"The effective part differs from the efficient one only in how far ahead and how widely it counts consequences, which makes it hard to measure.","title":"Effectiveness as a longer horizon"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200004A","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"the direction of flow between faculties","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005D3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005EF"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005FG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005GB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005J3"}],"prose":"The faculties are wired in a flow: judgment and perception feed the effective part, and the watcher spans every layer.","title":"Faculties feeding one another"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200004B","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"which aim yields when aims collide","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200004D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200004E"}],"prose":"Once parts carry different values, safety against speed, fairness against yield, their aims collide, and the collision is resolved one level up rather than among peers.","title":"Disagreement needs a mediator"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200004C","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
