{"body":{"matters":"what the arbiter may and may not touch","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007XX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000922"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000720"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007T8"}],"prose":"Conflicts are settled by fixed priorities or by adaptive strategies, always without reaching inside a part's own logic, only by steering what it receives and when it acts.","title":"Arbitration by rule or by learning"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200004E","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"how much power the top part holds","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200004G"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200004H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200004J"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200004K"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G200004M"}],"prose":"The interoperability holon begins as a connector and ends as the superholon with the highest authority, its core a language model choosing and composing workflows.","title":"The seat that appears at the top"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200004F","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"the autonomy each part is promised","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000002"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000XY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005NH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000633"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006YB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100096G"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AX3"}],"prose":"Again and again the text promises coordination without central control, autonomy kept, federation instead of integration.","title":"The vow of no centre"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200004G","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"the rank actually written in","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000S5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000720"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100086H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A18"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A6A"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009P6"}],"prose":"Alongside the vow stand plain statements of rank: top holons hold most authority, a guide is needed to synchronise the merely efficient, and in the case study one holon outranks all.","title":"Authority admitted"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200004H","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"the setting of the autonomy dial","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003MJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008K2"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000922"}],"prose":"How far the top may reach is left adjustable: parts are not necessarily fully autonomous, and the workflow builders can be removed so the top only watches execution.","title":"Autonomy as a dial"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200004J","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"what kind of mind sits in the seat","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100086H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008BN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008DY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008GG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008HG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008JG"}],"prose":"The deciding and translating components are proposed as language models, chosen for their reasoning and for adapting to unfamiliar inputs; around them a graph of capabilities lets elements be found and chained.","title":"A language model in the chair"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200004K","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
