{"body":{"matters":"what a faculty is made of","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000CA"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003VP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004H6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004RR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004V7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004PV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100050V"}],"prose":"Ethics, understanding and fairness are each to be built from formal vocabularies: of norms, of domains, of known biases. The faculties are distinct but rest on one substrate.","title":"Ontology underneath every faculty"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200004R","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
